<title>UK: Finelist to buy Tomkins' Ferraris Piston.</title>
<headline>Finelist to buy Tomkins' Ferraris Piston.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British automotive components distributor Finelist Plc said Thursday it planned to buy Tomkins Plc's Ferraris Piston Service Ltd for 52 million stg and would partly fund the acquisition with a rights issue.</p>
<p>Finelist also said its pretax profit for the six months to December 31 was not less than 7.0 million stg, compared to 4.05 million in the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
